; RT42 / PT42 (#738). Handwritten DXF; no Tecnigrafo execution.
; 100/101: vertical k=0 lies on the left/right side, length 10.
; 102: vertical family rotated +360 degrees; 103: MIRROR in the X axis.
; 104/105: vertical family rotated +90/-90 about (0,0).
; 106: vertical family rotated +90 about (5,5), origin becomes (10,0).
; The coordinates are exact quarter-turn transforms; spacing remains 3.175.
; All lists are family order, then increasing k (including negative step).
D = DXF file=input.dxf
; PT42 starts drawing the stored pattern families.
; cambia con #738
; Handle 100: 8 generated shapes.
? generated D:100 -> LINE start=0,0 end=10,0; LINE start=0,3.175 end=10,3.175; LINE start=0,6.35 end=10,6.35; LINE start=0,9.524999999999999 end=10,9.524999999999999; LINE start=9.524999999999999,0 end=9.524999999999999,10; LINE start=6.35,0 end=6.35,10; LINE start=3.175,0 end=3.175,10; LINE start=0,0 end=0,10
; Handle 101: 8 generated shapes.
? generated D:101 -> LINE start=-10,0 end=0,0; LINE start=-10,3.175 end=0,3.175; LINE start=-10,6.35 end=0,6.35; LINE start=-10,9.524999999999999 end=0,9.524999999999999; LINE start=0,0 end=0,10; LINE start=-3.175,0 end=-3.175,10; LINE start=-6.35,0 end=-6.35,10; LINE start=-9.524999999999999,0 end=-9.524999999999999,10
; Handle 102: 4 generated shapes.
? generated D:102 -> LINE start=9.524999999999999,0 end=9.524999999999999,10; LINE start=6.35,0 end=6.35,10; LINE start=3.175,0 end=3.175,10; LINE start=0,0 end=0,10
; Handle 103: 4 generated shapes.
? generated D:103 -> LINE start=9.524999999999999,0 end=9.524999999999999,-10; LINE start=6.35,0 end=6.35,-10; LINE start=3.175,0 end=3.175,-10; LINE start=0,0 end=0,-10
; Handle 104: 4 generated shapes.
